       Note  that  the  Sun console escape sequences are recognized by XFree86
       _x_t_e_r_m and by _d_t_t_e_r_m.  The _r_e_s_i_z_e program may be installed  as  _s_u_n_s_i_z_e,
       which causes makes it assume the --ss option.

       The  _r_o_w_s  and _c_o_l_u_m_n_s arguments must appear last; though they are nor‐
       mally associated with the --ss option, they are parsed separately.

